+To our knowledge, no prior work systematically compares pretrained vision backbones, 1D temporal convolutional networks, and audio-specific 2D depthwise-separable CNNs within a fixed microcontroller deployment budget for avian acoustic recognition. MynaNet addresses this gap through a multi-phase architectural investigation culminating in a 267~KB INT8 model validated via controlled ablations and multi-seed evaluation.
 
